{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mini ERP + CRM Operations Portal API",
    "description": "Complete REST API for the Mini ERP + CRM Operations Portal.\n\n## Getting started\n1. Set the `baseUrl` collection variable (default `http://localhost:4000/api/v1`).\n2. Run **Auth → Login (Admin)**. The token is captured automatically into the `token` variable by a test script, so every other request is authenticated.\n3. Run **Customers → Create customer** and **Products → Create product** — their ids are also captured automatically into `customerId` / `productId`, which the challan requests reuse.\n\nAll authenticated requests send `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` via collection-level auth.\n\n## Roles\nSwitch role by running a different login request. The API enforces the role matrix server-side, so the *Role-based access* folder demonstrates real 403 responses.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Password@123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "challanId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] },
            "description": "Public liveness probe. Also verifies the database connection. Expect 200."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Role permission matrix",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/meta/roles", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["meta", "roles"] },
            "description": "Returns every role with the permissions it holds. Expect 200."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);",
                  "pm.test('returns a JWT and the permission set', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user.permissions).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@erpcrm.test\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Full access, including user administration. Saves the token for all later requests."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Sales)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"sales@erpcrm.test\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Customers, follow-ups and sales challans."
